        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Olaf gains <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">10/15/20 Armor</span> and <span>10/15/20 Magic Resist</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active: </span>Olaf cleanses all <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilizing</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Disabling</span> effects on himself and becomes immune to them for 3 seconds. While active, Olaf gains <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-500\">(10/20/30 + (25% Attack Damage)) Attack Damage</span>. Hitting a champion with an Attack or <span>Reckless Swing</span> extends the duration by 2.5 seconds.<br /><br />Additionally, Olaf gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20/45/70% Move Speed</span> towards enemy champions for 1 second.",
